window.EN={"1":"...With bitter regret still held in their hearts,","2":"Leif and his companions escaped Munster.","3":"Many members of the Magi Squad also accompany them, hoping for a comeback.","4":"But the danger had not passed.","5":"Many bounty hunters were after Leif's head and the high price on it,","6":"and behind them, Munster's pursuing troops were closing in.","7":"Prince, at this rate the Munster army will catch up with us.","8":"What should we do?","9":"There are two ways. Flee into the Thracian mountains to the west and shake off the knights' pursuit,","10":"or continue south as we are and take refuge in Meath Castle...","11":"In either case, it will be necessary to seek Thracia's protection.","12":"Seek Thracia's protection?","13":"Absurd. Thracia is the hated enemy that destroyed my homeland and took my father and mother.","14":"I have no intention of accepting Thracia's protection!!","15":"Do you intend to put your soldiers in danger over your own feelings alone, Prince?","16":"Do not misunderstand. We are not fighting to help you take your revenge.","17":"We rose up to liberate northern Thracia from the Empire's tyranny.","18":"That's true, but... can Thracia be trusted? They are the Empire's allies.","19":"If another country violates its border, even the Thracian army will not stay silent.","20":"In particular, General Hannibal of Meath Castle is a warrior so renowned he is called the \"Shield of Thracia.\"","21":"If we say we have fled from Raydrik of Munster, he will surely help us.","22":"All right. Then let's take refuge in Meath Castle for now. Going to Tahra comes after that.","23":"Tahra, you say? ...I hear the city of Tahra resisted the child hunts and is under siege by the imperial army.","24":"Heading for Tahra with this small force means death. Is that acceptable to you?","25":"Tahra is my second home. Its lord, the Duke of Tahra, was killed by the Empire for protecting me.","26":"I have many friends there too. August! I want to save Tahra!","27":"...Understood. Let us discuss that matter again later.","28":"For now, please think only of escaping!","29":"The rebels are mainly infantry, so they cannot get very far.","30":"Eisenau, lead the cavalry and annihilate them in one stroke.","31":"Dispose of every one of them before they get near Meath Castle.","32":"Yes. ...However, Thracia is our ally.","33":"Will the rebels really flee into Meath Castle?","34":"...The Empire and Thracia may be allied, but they are by no means on good terms.","35":"If anything, one might say they are on bad terms.","36":"If there is anyone among that lot with even a little foresight,","37":"he will surely think to make use of this situation.","38":"I see.","39":"If I am worrying over nothing, so much the better. In any case, hurry.","40":"However, Hannibal's armored corps is stationed at Meath Castle.","41":"Whatever you do, you must not fight them. Understood!?","42":"Yes, sir!","43":"It's noisy. What's going on...","44":"Seems there was a commotion in Munster.","45":"Word is the ringleader is some youngster called Leif, a survivor of the Leonster royal family.","46":"Kill him or capture him, and there's a fat bounty... A tasty bit of prey for the first time in a while.","47":"Hmm...","48":"Welcome back, General Hannibal.","49":"It seems there are people held in the cells. Did something happen while I was away?","50":"Sir. There were suspicious persons in our territory, so we apprehended them.","51":"Most likely bandits who came from around the eastern frontier...","52":"Hmm... What do they themselves say?","53":"They say foolish things like \"we're just villagers,\"","54":"but judging from their brazenness, they must be considerable villains.","55":"However... there was one who appeared to be a knight, and we let that man get away.","56":"We currently have men split up searching for him.","57":"Mm, understood. I will hear what they have to say later.","58":"More to the point, things seem noisy around Munster.","59":"That Raydrik may be plotting something. Do not relax your vigilance!","60":"Sir, understood!","61":"I wonder if Lord Leif is safe... I must hurry and go to him...","62":"I must be going now. Sister, please go back to the town.","63":"Sir Finn, am I a burden after all?","64":"No, not at all. Your help is reassuring, but I am not confident I can protect you, Sister.","65":"When I left Tahra, I swore to Heim, the god of war,","66":"that for the sake of the hero who will protect Tahra, I would not shrink even from being called to God.","67":"Sir Finn, there is no need to concern yourself over me. If I can be of use, please take me with you.","68":"Very well. If you go so far as to say that, Sister...","69":"Then let us go. We must find the prince before the sun sets.","70":"I wonder if Lord Leif is safe...","71":"What, the Munster army is closing in on this castle?","72":"Hmph, Raydrik, do you take me lightly!?","73":"Armored corps! Sortie at once!","74":"Let us teach them just how fearsome our corps is!!","75":"What, Hannibal has come out? This is bad...","76":"It can't be helped. Pull back. All troops, retreat to Munster!","77":"Lord Leif!! You were safe!","78":"Finn. I made you worry.","79":"No, knowing you, Lord Leif, I believed you would surely be safe, but to think I would see you again so soon...","80":"This is all thanks to the Magi Squad.","81":"The Magi Squad? ...They are called the Magi Squad?","82":"There seem to be knights and mercenaries among them. Who on earth are they?","83":"They are Munster's rebel army. They said they would help me until the day the city is liberated.","84":"That is good news indeed. By the way, Lord Leif, I don't see Eyvel...","85":"Eyvel is in Munster... She was turned to stone by a priest of Loptr.","86":"There's nothing we can do right now...","87":"!... How could such a thing... Lord Leif... forgive me...","88":"There's nothing for you to apologize for, Finn. Besides, Eyvel... I will get her back, I swear!","89":"Listen, Finn. We will get Eyvel back with our own hands!","90":"So don't die, Finn! Until the day we return to Munster, you absolutely must not die!","91":"Yes, sir. I swear on this Brave Lance, I will never again leave your side, Lord Leif!!","92":"Mm... By the way, Finn, what happened to everyone else?","93":"They are being held in Meath Castle.","94":"I considered a rescue, but I thought I should see you first, Prince, and left things as they were.","95":"I see. So either way, we're meant to go to Meath...","96":"Finn, let's join up with everyone in Meath, and after that go to Tahra!","97":"That city must be nostalgic for you too, Finn.","98":"Yes, Lord Leif!","99":"Father!?","100":"Nanna... I'm glad you're safe. Are you all right? You're not hurt anywhere?","101":"Yes. Eyvel protected me...","102":"I see... Good.","103":"If something were to happen to you, what could I ever say to apologize to her...","104":"Father...","105":"Hm? What is it? Is something wrong?","106":"No... I'm sorry. It's nothing...","107":"Heh... What a strange girl. Anyway, fall back to the rear.","108":"We need your support with staves, but it is still too early for you to fight.","109":"Yes, Father...","110":"Oh, you're...","111":"The sister... It's been a while.","112":"Why are you doing something like this? You're not a bad person...","113":"This is my job. It has nothing to do with you, Sister. Now, step aside.","114":"No. I won't move.","115":"...Are you saying you'd throw away your life for that boy, Sister?","116":"Yes. If you wish it!","117":"......","118":"Prince Leif is irreplaceable to Thracia.","119":"If my life can be exchanged for his, I'll gladly give it.","120":"Hmph... What a foolish thing for a woman to say... Fine... do as you like.","121":"What!? Then you'll help the prince?","122":"Yeah... It's started to seem kind of stupid.","123":"But Sister, let me tell you one thing.","124":"Don't speak lightly of death in front of me. I can't stand people who rush to their deaths!","125":"I'm sorry... I'll be careful.","126":"Sister, may I ask you one thing? What is your wish?","127":"What would it take for you to laugh brightly?","128":"My wish is for all people to be happy. If everyone smiles, I can smile too.","129":"I see... I was a fool to ask.","130":"Well, fine. I'm Shiva of Savan. Your name?","131":"Safy. Safy of Tahra.","132":"I hear you're going to Tahra? Then take this antidote with you.","133":"When you've been poisoned, rub this medicine on the wound and the poison's gone in an instant.","134":"Rumor has it that among the thieves who hold sway in the west, there are some who use poisoned weapons.","135":"Take poison lightly and you'll be in for it. So take this along.","136":"Eek! Forgive me! It was just a moment of weakness...","137":"Huh? You're not the Meath Castle garrison? What, don't scare me like that.","138":"Forget what just happened, okay? In exchange, I'll give you this.","139":"If you like, why not try going to the arena to the south?","140":"If you fight and win there you'll get money, and it's a bit of a test of your skill, too.","141":"Oh, but losing there means losing your life,","142":"so don't get carried away and do anything too reckless. \"In moderation\" is best in all things!","143":"If you're going, I'll give you this for emergencies. I think it'll be of some use.","144":"I hear you fled from Munster. What happened?","145":"Yes. We lived on the east coast,","146":"and were arrested for the crime of resisting the child hunts.","147":"But we were saved by the town's resistance and escaped together with them.","148":"Hmm... You are still young, but you have quite a fine face. Your name?","149":"Lugh Faris, General Hannibal.","150":"Hmm, a resemblance...","151":"Huh? ...To what?","152":"No, it is nothing. More importantly, what do you intend to do now?","153":"I intend to go to Tahra. I have friends in that city.","154":"Do you intend to cross the central mountains?","155":"Yes. We are rebels. We cannot walk through imperial territory.","156":"I see... There are many bandits in that area. Go carefully.","157":"Yes. Then will you release my companions?","158":"Yes, of course. Someone, bring them here!","159":"Sir!...","160":"Prince Leif! You came. Sorry, we were no help at all...","161":"Damn those Thracians! Next time I see them, I won't let them off easy!!","162":"Prince Leif, forgive us. All because we lacked the strength...","163":"It is not much of an apology, but...","164":"Carrion, guide these people.","165":"The central mountains have many hard passes. And around Purple Dragon Mountain, a large-scale bandit hunt is under way.","166":"If you were mistaken for them again, this time you might lose your lives.","167":"Yes, sir. As you command.","168":"General, you needn't go that far. We'll be...","169":"Please take me with you. I want to go with you!","170":"...If you insist, then please, as far as Purple Dragon Mountain.","171":"Yes!","172":"Hello!","173":"Oh, you're the one from Kelves... Why are you here?","174":"Hannibal is my father. And so, this...","175":"It's a very powerful staff called the Warp staff. I'm giving it to you as thanks.","176":"Thank you. But is it really all right...","177":"Sir Lugh, the sun will set. You had best be setting out soon.","178":"Yes. Thank you for everything, General Hannibal.","179":"I will never forget this kindness!","180":"You whelps! Do you think you can defeat me!!","181":"Absurd... How can this be..."};
